        "content": "<p>In case this is blocking you,</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"m \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">extern</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkIdent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`c</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"123\"</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kn\">opaque</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">())</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>works (but maybe the <code>extern</code> attribute should simply erase macro